sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 审查人员
    participant UI as Web 控制台
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant MQ as Redis
    participant Worker as Celery Worker
    participant Git as Git 仓库
    participant Scan as 扫描器组

    User->>UI: 填写仓库 URL、ref、部署类型
    UI->>API: POST /api/submit
    API->>DB: 创建 pending / queued 任务
    API->>MQ: 发布 run_review(task_id)
    API-->>UI: 202 Accepted + task_id

    Worker->>MQ: 消费任务
    Worker->>DB: running / fetching
    Worker->>Git: 校验来源并拉取指定 ref
    Git-->>Worker: 精确 commit 快照
    Worker->>DB: 保存 resolved_commit，进入 scanning

    loop 五个扫描器顺序执行
        Worker->>Scan: 扫描只读临时快照
        Scan-->>Worker: 原始 findings / 扫描状态 / 耗时
        Worker->>Worker: 归一化证据并记录 tool_run
    end

    Worker->>Worker: 汇总证据并执行确定性仲裁
    Worker->>DB: 保存 result，进入 completed

    loop 前端轮询
        UI->>API: GET /api/tasks/{task_id}
        API->>DB: 查询任务状态与结果
        DB-->>API: task + result
        API-->>UI: 当前进度或最终结论
    end

    User->>UI: 查看风险 / 下载 JSON 或 Markdown 报告

    alt 编排异常且仍可重试
        Worker->>DB: pending / retrying + error
        Worker->>MQ: 延迟重新入队
    else 达到最大重试次数
        Worker->>DB: failed + error + finished_at
    end
